rummage: local multimodal semantic search
https://github.com/av/rummage

rummage itself has no open-source licence yet; this build is for private use. Its embedding
engine (crates/rummage-embed) is Apache-2.0.

The binary contains llama.cpp and ggml (MIT licence, below), statically linked, and Rust crates
listed in Cargo.lock under their own licences (mostly MIT or Apache-2.0). GPU builds load
vendor runtime libraries from the system (Vulkan loader, ROCm, CUDA) that are not included.

The EmbeddingGemma 2 model (google/embeddinggemma-2) is not included. rummage downloads its
GGUF files on first use; the model is under Apache 2.0, and the Gemma prohibited use policy
applies (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).
